{
 "comment": "Owner view for NORMAL (non-Bot) conversations. Rows are history rows (role user|assistant|action|error|notice, text, sender {kind, messageId, sessionId, conversationTitle, projectName}, steered, forOwner on a trigger row = the turn was marked for the owner). expected = ownerView per row. sender.sessionId \"$SELF\" must be replaced by the conversation's own sessionId (a message_self). initialTurn (server only) = the turn the page starts in; the panel instead reads ownerView on rows before the first user row. Server: server/owner-view.ts ownerRowView. Panel: rc-chat.js owner mode. The Bot chat keeps its own table (bot-view-table.json), unchanged.",
 "cases": [
  {
   "name": "an owner turn shows everything",
   "rows": [
    {
     "role": "user",
     "text": "u:owner"
    },
    {
     "role": "action",
     "text": "Bash ls"
    },
    {
     "role": "assistant",
     "text": "r"
    }
   ],
   "expected": [
    "show",
    "show",
    "show"
   ]
  },
  {
   "name": "an agent message hides its trigger, tools and replies",
